# Line endings: LF in the working tree on every platform. Golden snapshots, the vendored scripts (hashed by TestVendoredJSMatchesManifest),
# the rules JSON (hashed into the concept graph) and the shell scripts (a CR breaks them) are compared byte for byte.
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks them out with CRLF and the tests fail. docs/collaborating.md, "Windows".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert binaries.
*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
